&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your interest in Encore! The Encore program is a one-month abroad program for adults ages 55 and up. The program curates an immersive abroad experience for a cohort of like-minded&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;travelers&lt;/em&gt;, not tourists, who will join you as your support community alongside our local city managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The success of each Encore program depends on the cohort. To that end, we ask you to take 5-10 minutes to complete this initial registration form so that our team can learn more about you and help you decide if the program is a good fit for you. Upon receipt of your form, our team will contact you to schedule a call. Our goal is to ensure that we can meet your expectations for your abroad experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the meantime, if you have any questions, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:encore@sagecorps.com&quot;&gt;encore@sagecorps.com&lt;/a&gt; and our team will endeavor to get back to you within two business days. We look forward to learning more about you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*For this program, your passport must be valid for at least 6 months after your date of return to the United States.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**The resume upload question below is completely optional. If you have a resume and would like to share with our team - that&#39;s great, but it is not necessary!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline: &lt;/strong&gt;November 20, 2026&lt;/p&gt;

